{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01V7abKG4jdq3YxuyABd6fgJ", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Letter_to_Momo\"}, {\"url\": \"https://miff.com.au/festival-archive/films/23949/a-letter-to-momo\"}, {\"url\": \"https://blog.alltheanime.com/a-letter-to-momo/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://screenanarchy.com/2011/02/jin-roh-director-returns-with-a-letter-to-momo.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.cartoonbrew.com/biz/director-hiroyuki-okiura-announces-next-film-a-letter-to-momo-36704.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://cinando.com/en/Film/a_letter_to_momo_109621/Detail\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.mplus.org.hk/en/cinema/fresh-eyes/a-letter-to-momo\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.productionig.com/contents/news/2011/02/hiroyuki_okiura.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://s.media-imdb.com/name/nm0645657\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:53:30.746Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "A Letter to Momo ももへの手紙 director Okiura", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01UE3QeJJjFfrMSqAGDzRBEj", "content": [{"title": "A Letter to Momo", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Letter_to_Momo"}, {"title": "A LETTER TO MOMO", "url": "https://miff.com.au/festival-archive/films/23949/a-letter-to-momo"}, {"title": "A Letter to Momo", "url": "https://blog.alltheanime.com/a-letter-to-momo/"}, {"title": "JIN-ROH Director Returns With A LETTER TO MOMO", "url": "https://screenanarchy.com/2011/02/jin-roh-director-returns-with-a-letter-to-momo.html"}, {"title": "director hiroyuki okiura announces next film a letter to momo 36704", "url": "https://www.cartoonbrew.com/biz/director-hiroyuki-okiura-announces-next-film-a-letter-to-momo-36704.html"}, {"title": "A LETTER TO MOMO", "url": "https://cinando.com/en/Film/a_letter_to_momo_109621/Detail"}, {"title": "a letter to momo", "url": "https://www.mplus.org.hk/en/cinema/fresh-eyes/a-letter-to-momo"}, {"title": "hiroyuki okiura", "url": "https://www.productionig.com/contents/news/2011/02/hiroyuki_okiura.html"}, {"title": "Hiroyuki Okiura", "url": "https://s.media-imdb.com/name/nm0645657"}]}, "A Letter to Momo (Momo e no Tegami) was directed by Hiroyuki Okiura, who also wrote the screenplay. It is his second feature after Jin-Roh.\n\n- **Background:** Okiura's first feature, Jin-Roh, was completed in 2000. From Jin-Roh's completion in 2000 until now Okiura has filled the director's chair only once, that being for the title sequence of the 2001 Cowboy Bebop feature film.\n- **Production:** The film was made by Production I.G and took about seven years. The film was described as combining state-of-the-art traditional hand drawn animation with heart-warming, emotional storytelling for children and adults alike.\n- **Premiere and release:** It premiered at the 2011 Toronto International Film Festival, and its Japanese theatrical release followed on April 21, 2012, according to Wikipedia.\n- **Plot:** A grieving 13-year-old girl, Momo, moves to a remote island with her mother after her father's death. She finds his unfinished letter and meets three mischievous spirits (yōkai).\n- **Reception:** The film won several festival awards, including the Asia Pacific Screen Awards' Best Animated Feature Film in 2012, per Cinando's listing.\n\nSources: Wikipedia, MIFF, Production I.G, Cinando, M+, and IMDb."], "durationSeconds": 5.236831167, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01V7abKG4jdq3YxuyABd6fgJ", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
