{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXEgSZQY4H17Z1ywzCF", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：沖浦启之（Hiroyuki Okiura）**\n\n《给小桃的信》是日本动画电影《ももへの手紙》（英文名 *A Letter to Momo*）的中文译名，由 Production I.G 制作。沖浦启之执导并编写剧本，这是他继《人狼》之后的第二部长片。影片 2011 年在多伦多电影节首映，2012 年 4 月在日本上映。\n\n说明：用中文片名搜索没有找到这部片，所以我改用日文和英文片名去搜。“《给小桃的信》就是《ももへの手紙》”这一点是我自己知道的，下面的网页里没有出现这个中文片名。共搜索 2 次。\n\n依据网址：\n- [A Letter to Momo – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Letter_to_Momo)\n- [Production I.G：Hiroyuki Okiura 新作公告](https://www.productionig.com/contents/news/2011/02/hiroyuki_okiura.html)\n- [Cartoon Brew：Director Hiroyuki Okiura Announces Next Film A Letter to Momo](https://www.cartoonbrew.com/biz/director-hiroyuki-okiura-announces-next-film-a-letter-to-momo-36704.html)\n- [MIFF：A Letter to Momo](https://miff.com.au/festival-archive/films/23949/a-letter-to-momo)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1136, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5095, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1136}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:53:37.319Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXEgASzpNd5RN6zy33L"}
